{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "creative-ideation-package",
  "name": "Creative Strategy: Ideation",
  "version": "1",
  "description": "Installs a brand-agnostic creative ideation workflow that interviews a team about how it develops ad ideas, configures a workspace-specific ideation engine, builds workspace-scoped and human-confirmed creative-mechanics, hooks-and-headlines, and visual-format banks from real ad evidence, and produces traceable concepts with separate execution options. Its package instruction offers setup once per conversation until completion, discloses connected-workspace reads and persistent writes before starting, never saves bank entries without confirmation, and requires separate approval before creating the weekly nominations routine.",
